{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12691","headline":"詶裴云客 · 元结","name":"詶裴云客","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"自厌久荒浪，於时无所任。\n耕钓以爲事，来家樊水阴。\n甚醉或漫歌，甚闲亦漫吟。\n不知愚僻意，称得云客心。\n云客方持斧，与人正相临。\n符印随坐起，守位常森森。\n纵能有相招，岂暇来山林。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元结","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12691.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12691","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}